{
  "text": "Nick Kozyrev\n\nmenu\n\nWe document ideas in motion — from digital craft to visual storytelling. Here you’ll find essays, process notes, and studio reflections.\n\nDigital Poetics — When Code Becomes Canvas\n\nDigital Art\n\nOCT 2025\n\nDigital Poetics — When Code Becomes Canvas\n\nWe’ll be in Budapest speaking alongside some of the design industry’s best minds on the topic of “Making Sense.”\n\nOCT 2025\n\nThe Aesthetics of Technology — Designing the Invisible\n\nWe’ll be in Budapest speaking alongside some of the design industry’s best minds on the topic of “Making Sense.”\n\nSep 2025\n\nHuman Machines — Art at the Edge of Intelligence\n\nWe’ll be in Budapest speaking alongside some of the design industry’s best minds on the topic of “Making Sense.”\n\nAug 2025\n\nGenerative Design — When Creativity Becomes Autonomous\n\nWe’ll be in Budapest speaking alongside some of the design industry’s best minds on the topic of “Making Sense.”\n\nJun 2025\n\nBeyond the Screen — The Future of Digital Presence\n\nWe’ll be in Budapest speaking alongside some of the design industry’s best minds on the topic of “Making Sense.”\n\nMay 2025\n\nArchitecture in Motion — The New Language of Digital Space\n\nWe’ll be in Budapest speaking alongside some of the design industry’s best minds on the topic of “Making Sense.”\n\nMay 2025\n\n2026 Nick Kozyrev.\n\ntelegram\n\nCreate a free website with Framer, the website builder loved by startups, designers and agencies.",
